2. README.md — MIT, Copyright (c) 2023 Federico Del Gaudio
-----------------------------------------------------------

This file previously contained ONLY the MIT notice below, which made it read
as though abc2xml.py were MIT-licensed. It is not, and never was.

That MIT notice arrived with the small GitHub mirror this directory was
copied from — a repository whose stated purpose was "to have quick access to
the script with the steps required to use it easily for importing ABC files
into MuseScore" (see README.md). It covers Del Gaudio's own contribution,
the packaging and instructions, and it is retained below for that reason.
It does not, and cannot, relicense Willem Vree's work.

